Dear All, 
 
LTP Announces the next stable release of LTP-DEVEL-2.0.0.0 RPM Packages
for i386, x86_64, ia64, ppc64 & s390x. The same can be picked up from: 
 
http://ltp.sourceforge.net/ 
 
The Original motivation to create these Packages is to allow developers
to write unit testcases in LTP, without the need to download the entire
LTP test tree. Now, they can straightaway write Test Cases and can
integrate them to LTP in future. The README.ltp-devel-2.0 file contains
all instructions to do so. 
 
I would request community to create similar LTP-DEVEL Package for other
architectures as well, and, share the same with us. 
 
Happy Testing-- 
Subrata

